# ARCH03 3a desktop run (the in-kernel desktop is the F1 risk: it calls the
# GEMDOS file surface with kernel pointers through `svc #1`, Space::Kernel).
# Window C:\D3A\ restored from NEWDESK.INF (#W 02 04 26 0C, the DESK50 run-B
# geometry), items SUB3A (folder) / HELLO.NCP / NOTE.TXT at the DESK50 run-B
# slots: glyph centres (63,120) / (147,120) / (231,120); closer (27,74).
# Ticks hz_200 (5 ms) after "[desk] desktop up".
100 parkbr
400 mark A_IDLE
600 move 63 120
800 down
803 up
808 down
811 up
2000 mark B_SUB
2200 move 27 74
2400 down
2405 up
3400 mark C_UP
3600 move 231 120
3800 down
3805 up
4000 parkbr
4400 mark D_SELECTED
# File > Show info: Ctrl-I (Ctrl 1D, I 17)
4600 key 1D
4610 key 17
4620 key 97
4630 key 9D
5600 mark E_INFO
# Esc clears the name field, then "REN.TXT"
5800 key 01
5805 key 81
5900 key 13
5905 key 93
5920 key 12
5925 key 92
5940 key 31
5945 key B1
5960 key 34
5965 key B4
5980 key 14
5985 key 94
6000 key 2D
6005 key AD
6020 key 14
6025 key 94
6400 mark F_TYPED
# Return = the default button (OK): the rename
6600 key 1C
6605 key 9C
7800 mark G_RENAMED
# Alt-C: open drive C in a second window
8000 key 38
8010 key 2E
8020 key AE
8030 key B8
9600 mark H_DRIVE_C
